{
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "strings": {
    "Open notification settings": {
      "comment": "Android only. Settings > Weekly rhythm, under the note that notifications are off for Dredfit: opens the app's notification settings in the phone's Settings. The Android twin of iOS's \"Open iOS Settings\".",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Benachrichtigungseinstellungen öffnen"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Abrir ajustes de notificaciones"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ouvrir les paramètres de notification"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apri impostazioni notifiche"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Abrir configurações de notificação"
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Открыть настройки уведомлений"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open phone settings": {
      "comment": "Android only. Settings > Weekly rhythm, the row under the battery note: opens Dredfit's own page in the phone's Settings app (App info), where its Battery row holds \"Unrestricted\". The phone's settings, not Dredfit's own Settings screen this row sits on.",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Handy-Einstellungen öffnen"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Abrir ajustes del teléfono"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ouvrir les paramètres du téléphone"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apri impostazioni del telefono"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Abrir configurações do celular"
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Открыть настройки телефона"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Rate on Google Play": {
      "comment": "Android only. Settings > About: opens the app's Google Play page, where a review is written. The Android twin of iOS's \"Rate on the App Store\".",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bei Google Play bewerten"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Calificar en Google Play"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Noter sur Google Play"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Valuta su Google Play"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Avaliar no Google Play"
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Оценить в Google Play"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "So the reminder arrives on its own, without waiting for you to pick up the phone, let Dredfit run without battery restrictions.": {
      "comment": "Android only. Settings > Weekly rhythm, under the reminder while it is on, shown only on Samsung phones that do not yet let Dredfit run without battery restrictions: Samsung freezes the app in the background and holds the reminder back until the person turns the screen on. The fix is the app's battery setting \"Unrestricted\" in the phone's Settings. Use the word the phone's Settings use for the battery.",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Damit die Erinnerung von selbst kommt und nicht wartet, bis du das Handy in die Hand nimmst, lass Dredfit ohne Akku-Einschränkungen laufen."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Para que el recordatorio llegue solo, sin esperar a que tomes el teléfono, deja que Dredfit funcione sin restricciones de batería."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pour que le rappel arrive tout seul, sans attendre que tu prennes ton téléphone, laisse Dredfit fonctionner sans restriction de batterie."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Perché il promemoria arrivi da solo, senza aspettare che tu prenda il telefono, lascia funzionare Dredfit senza limitazioni della batteria."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Para o lembrete chegar sozinho, sem esperar você pegar o celular, deixe o Dredfit funcionar sem restrições de bateria."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Чтобы напоминание приходило само, а не ждало, пока ты возьмешь телефон, сними с Dredfit ограничения по батарее."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The tones play even when the phone is set to silent or vibrate.": {
      "comment": "Android only. Settings > Sounds, the caption under \"Play tones in Silent mode\" while it is ON. Android has no ringer switch: the phone's sound mode (ring, vibrate, silent) is what mutes the tones when the switch is off, and both vibrate and silent let them through when it is on. The vibration fires either way.",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die Töne spielen auch, wenn das Handy auf lautlos oder Vibration steht."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Los tonos suenan aunque el teléfono esté en silencio o en vibración."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les sons se font entendre même quand le téléphone est en mode Silencieux ou Vibreur."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I suoni si sentono anche con il telefono in modalità Silenzioso o Vibrazione."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Os sons tocam mesmo com o celular no modo Silencioso ou só vibrando."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Звуки играют, даже когда телефон в бесшумном режиме или на вибрации."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When the phone is set to silent or vibrate, the tones go quiet — the vibration keeps going.": {
      "comment": "Android only. Settings > Sounds, the caption under \"Play tones in Silent mode\" while it is OFF. Android has no ringer switch: the phone's sound mode is what mutes the tones, and vibrate mutes them as silent does. The vibration fires either way.",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Steht das Handy auf lautlos oder Vibration, bleiben die Töne stumm – die Vibration läuft weiter."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Con el teléfono en silencio o en vibración, los tonos no suenan, pero la vibración sigue."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quand le téléphone est en mode Silencieux ou Vibreur, les sons se taisent — la vibration continue."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Con il telefono in modalità Silenzioso o Vibrazione i suoni si spengono – la vibrazione continua."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Com o celular no modo Silencioso ou só vibrando, os sons ficam mudos — a vibração continua."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Когда телефон в бесшумном режиме или на вибрации, звуки молчат — вибрация продолжает работать."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Workout in progress": {
      "comment": "Android only. The name of the notification channel of the ongoing-workout notification (the Android twin of the iOS Live Activity), shown in the system's notification settings.",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Laufendes Training"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Entrenamiento en curso"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Séance en cours"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Allenamento in corso"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Treino em andamento"
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Текущая тренировка"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "version": "1.1"
}
